   "end": 154.2596,
   "text": "5 月单月，同比跌 24.9%。",
   "speaker": "L"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 5,
   "start": 155.2196,
   "end": 155.7823,
   "text": "……跌了。",
   "speaker": "L"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 6,
   "start": 157.0423,
   "end": 157.8405,
   "text": "跌了多少？",
   "speaker": "M"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 7,
   "start": 158.5605,
   "end": 160.1692,
   "text": "百分之二十四点九。",
   "speaker": "L"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 8,
   "start": 161.4892,
   "end": 168.5891,
   "text": "纯电在涨。800V 高压平台下放到十几万的车，充电五分钟能跑四百公里。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 9,
   "start": 169.3091,
   "end": 173.1661,
   "text": "当年逼着人选增程的那个理由，正在被拿走。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 10,
   "start": 174.4861,
   "end": 176.7991,
   "text": "那我这本账，是不是也算错了？",
   "speaker": "L"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 11,
   "start": 177.9991,
   "end": 178.7118,
   "text": "账没错。",
   "speaker": "M"
  },
  {
   "seg": "ACT4",
   "i": 12,
   "start": 180.0318,
   "end": 182.1984,
   "text": "是账本背后的东西，变了。",
   "speaker": "M"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 1,
   "start": 185.9584,
   "end": 187.4011,
   "text": "两个人都不说话了。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 2,
   "start": 188.4811,
   "end": 191.3099,
   "text": "桌上，多了一本新的空白手册。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 3,
   "start": 192.6299,
   "end": 193.8897,
   "text": "这本，还没写。",
   "speaker": "M"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 4,
   "start": 194.9097,
   "end": 195.9341,
   "text": "那就先空着。",
   "speaker": "L"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 5,
   "start": 197.4941,
   "end": 200.3667,
   "text": "2020 年，增程被判了死刑。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 6,
   "start": 201.0267,
   "end": 203.0374,
   "text": "2021 年，它翻了案。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 7,
   "start": 203.6974,
   "end": 207.278,
   "text": "2025 年，判它的人，自己开始造它。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 8,
   "start": 207.938,
   "end": 210.8366,
   "text": "2026 年，它自己也开始退潮。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 9,
   "start": 211.9166,
   "end": 213.3677,
   "text": "没有永远的裁判。",
   "speaker": "N"
  },
  {
   "seg": "CLOSE",
   "i": 10,
   "start": 214.5677,
   "end": 217.0656,
   "text": "只有不断被重新判决的技术。",
   "speaker": "N"
  }
 ],
